OL,4,CHamas political official and wife      
OL,5,Camong eight Palestinians killed in     
OL,6,CIsraeli strikes on Gaza                
OL,7,GA Hamas political official and his     
OL,8,Gwife were among eight Palestinians     
OL,9,Gkilled in three Israeli air strikes    
OL,10,Gacross the Gaza Strip on Thursday.     
OL,12,FLocal sources told the BBC a           
OL,13,Fresidential apartment in Deir al-Balah 
OL,14,Fwas targeted at dawn, killing Khaled   
OL,15,FAbu Nada - the deputy education        
OL,16,Fminister - and his wife, Abeer         
OL,17,FMohammed Ismail Abu Nada.              
